---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { journal } from '../lib/journal';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About IJATS"
  subtitle="Bridging academic innovation and real-world technology solutions."
  description="About the International Journal of Applied Technology Solutions — mission, aims and scope, editorial board, and indexing roadmap."
>
  <p>
    The <strong>{journal.name} ({journal.shortName})</strong> is a premier
    open-access journal dedicated to publishing cutting-edge research in applied
    technology across industries. IJATS aims to bridge the gap between academic
    innovation and real-world technology solutions, driving tangible impact
    across engineering, data science, healthcare, education, finance,
    manufacturing, and beyond.
  </p>
  <p>
    IJATS provides a global platform for researchers, practitioners, and thought
    leaders to share actionable insights and foster interdisciplinary
    collaboration that transforms emerging technologies into scalable,
    sustainable solutions.
  </p>

  <h2 id="mission-and-vision">Mission &amp; Vision</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Mission:</strong> To foster the dissemination of high-impact research
    that translates technological innovation into practical applications across
    industries, enhancing societal progress and sustainable development.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Vision:</strong> To become a globally recognized leader in publishing
    applied technology research — bridging theory and practice, and inspiring
    interdisciplinary solutions to the world's critical technological challenges.
  </p>

  <h2 id="aims-and-scope">Aims &amp; Scope</h2>
  <p>
    The primary aim of IJATS is to advance applied technology research that
    demonstrates clear industrial, societal, or economic benefits. We emphasize
    peer-reviewed, original contributions that translate theoretical advancements
    into real-world practice. IJATS welcomes original contributions in, but not
    limited to:
  </p>
  <ul>
    {journal.scope.map((topic) => <li>{topic}</li>)}
  </ul>
  <p>
    Both theoretical frameworks and practical deployments are encouraged, provided
    they highlight real-world applicability and technological impact.
  </p>

  <h2 id="editorial-board">Editorial Board</h2>
  <p><strong>Editor-in-Chief</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>{journal.editorInChief.name}</strong> — <em>{journal.editorInChief.title}</em>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We are actively expanding the Editorial Board. Researchers, practitioners, and
    industry leaders passionate about bridging research and practice are invited
    to join our growing academic community — please
    <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="indexing">Indexing &amp; Visibility</h2>
  <p>
    IJATS is committed to enhancing the visibility and impact of published
    research. Our indexing roadmap includes submissions to:
  </p>
  <ul>
    {journal.indexingRoadmap.map((idx) => <li>{idx}</li>)}
  </ul>
  <p>
    Through continuous improvement of our editorial practices, we aspire to be a
    leading journal indexed across major global scholarly databases. (ISSN:
    {' '}{journal.issn}.)
  </p>

  <hr />
  <p>
    <em>
      IJATS is committed to fostering a global exchange of knowledge and
      accelerating technology-driven change for a better tomorrow.
    </em>
  </p>
</PageLayout>
